=begin
= NAME

gem4.0 - frontend to RubyGems, the Ruby package manager

= SYNOPSIS

gem4.0 command [arguments...] [options...]

= DESCRIPTION

gem4.0 is the frontend to RubyGems, the standard package manager for Ruby.
This is a basic help message containing pointers to more information.

Further help:

: gem4.0 help commands
  list all gem4.0 commands

: gem4.0 help examples
  shows some examples of usage

: gem4.0 help ((|COMMAND|))
  show help on COMMAND, (e.g. 'gem4.0 help install')

= LINKS

http://rubygems.org/

= EXAMPLES

gem4.0 install rake
gem4.0 list --local
gem4.0 build package.gemspec
gem4.0 help install

= SEE ALSO

bundle(1)

=end
